=== Miscellaneous Changes ===
* The [[Online (open beta)|online co-op]] mode is no longer restricted to closed beta and now in open beta.
* A new [[co-op]] baby (#575 - Jones Baby) was added.
* A [[Deathmatch]] mini-game was added to coop mode.
* Any new title card that pops up (i.e. picking up a new item/pickup) immediately after another will display its name and description in a new line beneath the previous rather than replacing it.

=== Fixes ===
* Fixed {{i|Dream Catcher}} not showing the right items in Greed Mode or if {{t|Broken Glasses}} spawned a second item.
* Fixed the {{a|5 Nights at Mom's}} achievement not unlocking correctly when using some characters.
* Fixed {{c|Tainted Forgotten}} not being able to fire after Tainted Soul was getting hit while Tainted Forgotten was holding {{i|Glass Cannon}} over his head.
* Fixed {{i|Azazel's Rage}} not firing in {{r|Challenge Room}}s/{{r|Boss Rush}}.
* Fixed range ups reducing {{i|Monstro's Lung}} range.

